    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="u22" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;dashed=1;endArrow=open;fontSize=9;" target="y7">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="u23" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;dashed=1;endArrow=open;fontSize=9;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="y9">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#B03030;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1A1A1C;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;The rule that outranks everything else&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LinkedIn suppresses the reach of posts whose COPY carries an engagement instruction (comment X, like this, repost this). The keyword moved into the graphic and now has exactly one carrier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· Same asset, before and after the change: &lt;b&gt;95 → 11,432 impressions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· One account&#x27;s post with Comment &quot;KEYWORD&quot; in the copy: &lt;b&gt;43 impressions&lt;/b&gt;, the week after a post did 62,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Consequence: a graphic without a legible bar is a post that asks for nothing. There is no backup in the copy, by design. That is why the release gate is red.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Two image pipelines, do not confuse them:&lt;/b&gt; the cover generator makes the Notion page cover and NEVER carries the keyword. graphics-maker makes the post graphic and is the only place the keyword exists. &lt;b&gt;cta_mode: copy&lt;/b&gt; exists for people who want to test the old pattern; lint and doctor print these numbers every time it is on." vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="240" width="1290" x="20" y="1080" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8E6;strokeColor=#A6CB17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1A1A1C;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Human gates (the operator only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Approves the outline. Always.&lt;br&gt;2. Approves the written content. Only when &lt;b&gt;gates: two&lt;/b&gt; (default). With gates: one, Phase 2 ships the bundle with defaults.&lt;br&gt;3. Picks the winning scene for the graphic.&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;Release gate:&lt;/b&gt; reads the keyword character by character, at feed scale. A misspelled keyword breaks the DM trigger silently and the copy cannot save it. The Pillow bar typesets the exact string, so this gate is about legibility and identity, not spelling.&lt;br&gt;5. Publishes the guide to the web by hand. Never automatic. Until then the public link in the DM does not resolve; the publisher checks the URL.&lt;br&gt;6. Picks a variation, schedules the post, sets the keyword in the DM tool (or pastes the manual bundle).&lt;br&gt;7. Reads the weekly numbers and overrides rules in the strategy file. The agent treats that file as advisory." vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="240" width="1290" x="1340" y="1080" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#8C8C8C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1A1A1C;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Adapt it to your strategy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Config (yours):&lt;/b&gt; accounts and voices · community / direct / secondary-channel destinations · DM tool adapter and merge tag · image provider (or none: Pillow card) · word range and closers · hook taxonomy · excluded topics · channel, subreddit and X presets per niche · brand colors, fonts, logo · number of gates · one card per guide or per account.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Opinionated (the evidence says keep it):&lt;/b&gt; keyword in the graphic only · humanizer always on · two assets, cover never carries the keyword · scan-health block instead of silent web-search fallback · one-word keyword derived from the guide name, unique across everything · institutional sources cited, creator videos never · no cross-guide references · no nested sub-agents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Empty slots you fill:&lt;/b&gt; voice.md · your real posts in examples.md · top-performers.md · format library cards ingested from graphics you admire · strategy file." vertex="1">
      <mxGeometry height="240" width="1290" x="2660" y="1080" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
